TI  - Mari: Responsive Wireless Communication for Low-Power Large-Scale Robot Swarms
AU  - Fedrecheski, Geovane
AU  - Gao, Yinghao
AU  - Maksimovic, Filip
AU  - Abadie, Alexandre
AU  - Vučinić, Mališa
